          "title": "Batsford",
          "subtitle": "Patience",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Batsford is a two-deck Klondike-style patience game with a single pass through the stock and a reserve space for one king."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A two-pack patience related to Klondike, preserving tableau building while changing the scale and stock restrictions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "1 players use the table arrangement described for Batsford."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Two standard 52-card decks"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Two standard 52-card decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal a Klondike-like tableau using two decks, maintain foundations by suit, and allow a special reserve for a single king."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
